title:        KaTeX math fonts (formulas in messages)
author:       The KaTeX authors (Khan Academy and contributors)
source:       https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX, embedded through the ratex-katex-fonts crate (https://github.com/erweixin/RaTeX)
license:      OFL-1.1
